<div id="p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix</span></p>
</div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p">In the appendix, we will give more details and experiments that are omitted in the main paper.
Specifically, this appendix includes the following contents:</p>
</div>
<div id="p4" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A0.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A0.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A0.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Implementation details:</span> in Section <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Experimental Details ‣ From Evaluation to Defense:Constructing Persistent Edit-Based Fingerprints for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we present more implementation details, including the hyperparameters and environments, etc.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A0.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Compress Methods:</span> in Section <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Model Compress Methods ‣ From Evaluation to Defense:Constructing Persistent Edit-Based Fingerprints for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we provided a detailed introduction to model compression methods.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A0.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Experimental Results for Qwen3:</span> in Section <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Experimental Results for Qwen3 ‣ From Evaluation to Defense:Constructing Persistent Edit-Based Fingerprints for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>, we show more experimental results on Qwen3.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experimental Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our hyperparameter settings reflect a compromise across multiple dimensions, refined through extensive experimentation. The numbers indicate corresponding layer indices.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Llama3.2</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LoRA</span> For the Q and K modules across all attention layers, the rank is set to 8, the learning rate to <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the dropout to 0.1.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FT-M</span> For the [20].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">R-ROME</span> For the [6].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 27, and the v_weight_decay to <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EMMET</span> For the [6].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\text{\times}{10}^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\text{\times}{10}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 27, and the v_weight_decay to <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AlphaEdit</span> For the [13-17].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 27, and the v_weight_decay to 0.5.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">UltraEdit</span> For the [9-13].mlp.gate_proj modules and the [16-22].mlp.up_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Malmen</span> For the [22-27].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>, the meta learning rate to <math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, the loc_coef to 1, and the rank to 1920.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">RLEdit</span> For the [9-13].mlp.gate_proj modules and the [16-22].mlp.up_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>, the meta learning rate to <math id="A1.I1.i8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, the rank to 1024 and the loc_coef to 0.6.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DEFER</span> For the [24].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I1.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the threshold to 0.5.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">WISE</span> For the [27].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to 0.08, the mask_ratio to 0.2, the act_margin to [5.0, 20.0, 10.0], and the act_ratio to 0.64.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Qwen3</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LoRA</span> For the Q and K modules across all attention layers, the rank is set to 8, the learning rate to <math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the dropout to 0.1.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FT-M</span> For the [35].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">R-ROME</span> For the [8].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.2\text{\times}{10}^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 35, and the v_weight_decay to <math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">EMMET</span> For the [7].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\text{\times}{10}^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\text{\times}{10}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 35, and the v_weight_decay to <math id="A1.I2.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AlphaEdit</span> For the [11-15].mlp.down_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4\text{\times}{10}^{-2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4\text{\times}{10}^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math>, the v_loss_layer to 35, and the v_weight_decay to 0.5.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">UltraEdit</span> For the [13-17].mlp.gate_proj modules and the [22-28] .mlp.up_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Malmen</span> For the [30-35].mlp.down_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>, the meta learning rate to <math id="A1.I2.i7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, the loc_coef to 0.6, and the rank to 1920.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">RLEdit</span> For the [13-17].mlp.gate_proj modules and the [22-28].mlp.up_proj modules, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\text{\times}{10}^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>, the meta learning rate to 1e-5, the rank to 1024 and the loc_coef to 0.6.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DEFER</span> For the [32].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to <math id="A1.I2.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="7\text{\times}{10}^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>×</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7\text{\times}{10}^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the threshold to 0.1.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">WISE</span> For the [35].mlp.down_proj module, the learning rate is set to 0.004, the mask_ratio to 0.2, the act_margin to [5.0, 18.0, 10.0], and the act_ratio to 0.3.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Environments</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The experiments are conducted on a system equipped with two Quadro RTX 8000 GPUs with 48 GB of memory each, and six NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 GPUs with 24 GB of memory each.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Datasets</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The construction of fingerprint-related datasets is shown in the code appendix. Here, we provide a detailed introduction to the open-source datasets used.</p>
</div>
